      ":question/id": "0241b95f-2b75-5cc3-97c9-9862fe4bf540",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $BC-BA$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -4 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}- \\sqrt{5} & 1 & -1 \\\\ -2 & - \\sqrt{5} & 1 \\\\ 3 & \\sqrt{3} & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nFill in the missing entries.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$BC-BA=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>$-3$</td><td>$3$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>$-3$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$-9$</td><td>$- 3 \\sqrt{3}$</td><td>$-3$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Keep the common factor $B$ on the left and preserve the order of the subtraction:\n\n$$\nBC-BA=B(C-A).\n$$\n\nCombine corresponding entries first:\n\n$$\nC-A=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nThe combined matrix is $-3I_3$. Multiply every entry of $B$ by $-3$.\n\n$$\nBC-BA=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\sqrt{5} & -3 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 3 \\sqrt{5} & -3 \\\\ -9 & - 3 \\sqrt{3} & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n"
    }
  },
