      ":question/id": "27e48bbd-ab13-5e82-87ed-cecbb766b597",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $BA+CA$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -3 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 5 & 1 - \\sqrt{3} \\\\ 2 & 2 & \\sqrt{3} + 3 \\\\ -1 & \\sqrt{2} & -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nFill in the missing entries.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$BA+CA=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>$0$</td><td>$- \\sqrt{3}$</td><td>$0$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>$0$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>$1$</td><td>$0$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Keep the common factor $A$ on the right and preserve the order of the addition:\n\n$$\nBA+CA=(B+C)A.\n$$\n\nCombine corresponding entries first:\n\n$$\nB+C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & - \\sqrt{3} \\\\ 3 & 1 & \\sqrt{3} \\\\ 2 & \\sqrt{2} & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUse row-by-column multiplication on the shorter product $(B+C)A$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(BA+CA)_{21}&=0=0 \\\\ (BA+CA)_{22}&=(\\sqrt{3})(1)=\\sqrt{3} \\\\ (BA+CA)_{31}&=0=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nBA+CA=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & - \\sqrt{3} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt{3} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n"
    }
  },
