      ":question/id": "2aa790e7-9ea7-50de-8796-f47876af9ff4",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $BC-BA$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -4 & -1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 & - \\sqrt{5} \\\\ \\sqrt{3} & -3 & -3 \\\\ 1 & \\sqrt{5} & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -4 & -1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nFill in the missing entries.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$BC-BA=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>$0$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$0$</td><td>$-6$</td><td>{{field-3}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$0$</td><td>$4$</td><td>$0$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Keep the common factor $B$ on the left and preserve the order of the subtraction:\n\n$$\nBC-BA=B(C-A).\n$$\n\nCombine corresponding entries first:\n\n$$\nC-A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUse row-by-column multiplication on the shorter product $B(C-A)$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(BC-BA)_{11}&=0=0 \\\\ (BC-BA)_{12}&=(- \\sqrt{5})(2)=- 2 \\sqrt{5} \\\\ (BC-BA)_{23}&=0=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nBC-BA=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & - 2 \\sqrt{5} & 0 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n"
    }
