      ":question/id": "b8434b7d-6059-57f9-b363-a2a8b64d24d7",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $BC+AC$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -2 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -1 & -5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -4 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 0 & \\sqrt{2} \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & -2 & 0 \\\\ -3 & - \\sqrt{3} & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nFill in the missing entries.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$BC+AC=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>$6$</td><td>$0$</td><td>$- 2 \\sqrt{2}$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>$0$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>$2 \\sqrt{3}$</td><td>$4$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Keep the common factor $C$ on the right and preserve the order of the addition:\n\n$$\nBC+AC=(B+A)C.\n$$\n\nCombine corresponding entries first:\n\n$$\nB+A=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nThe combined matrix is $-2I_3$. Multiply every entry of $C$ by $-2$.\n\n$$\nBC+AC=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 0 & - 2 \\sqrt{2} \\\\ - 2 \\sqrt{2} & 4 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 2 \\sqrt{3} & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n"
    }
