      ":question/problem": "Calculate $BA+CA$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & \\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1 & 3 & - \\sqrt{3} \\\\ -3 & 1 & \\sqrt{5}\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 2 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nFill in the missing entries.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$BA+CA=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>$3$</td><td>$3 \\sqrt{2}$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>$- 3 \\sqrt{3}$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$-9$</td><td>$3$</td><td>$3 \\sqrt{5}$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Keep the common factor $A$ on the right and preserve the order of the addition:\n\n$$\nBA+CA=(B+C)A.\n$$\n\nCombine corresponding entries first:\n\n$$\nB+C=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nThe combined matrix is $3I_3$. Multiply every entry of $A$ by $3$.\n\n$$\nBA+CA=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 3 & 3 \\sqrt{2} \\\\ 3 & 9 & - 3 \\sqrt{3} \\\\ -9 & 3 & 3 \\sqrt{5}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n"
    }
